bin/
dist/
coverage.txt

# `go build ./cmd/faramir` by hand writes here.  make build writes to bin/.
/faramir

# opencode.json is a common entry in a personal ignore file, where it means the
# opencode config of whatever tree you are in.  Here it is an installed asset,
# named by internal/install/agents.go and embedded from this directory, so an
# ignore that reaches it leaves the enrolment failing on a host.
!agent/opencode/opencode.json
